559	     * Rejects a create whose E.164 telephone is already used by any existing owner. The
560	     * submitted telephone has already been normalized to E.164 by {@link #normalizeTelephone};
561	     * each stored owner's telephone is normalized the same way before comparison so differing
562	     * input formats collapse to the same value.
563	     *
564	     * @param normalizedTelephone the submitted, already-normalized E.164 telephone
565	     * @throws DuplicateTelephoneException with a 409 status if another owner already uses the
566	     *                                     same E.164 telephone
