350	     * assigned at create: a new owner joining an existing household without declaring it (see
351	     * {@code membershipLevelCap}) may not exceed one above the highest membership level already held
352	     * by an existing household member, so the returned level is the lesser of the derived level and
353	     * the cap. When no cap was assigned (a household's first member, or a declared member) the
354	     * derived level is returned unchanged.
