453	     * already-normalized {@code telephone} (E.164 form), its lower-cased {@code email} (empty
454	     * when absent) and the Soundex code of its {@code lastName} (see {@link #soundex}). Two owners
455	     * are duplicates only when their whole {@code identityKey} values are equal.
456	     *
457	     * @return the consolidated identity key
458	     */
